Package: loaf
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), docker-ce-cli | docker-cli | docker.io, docker-compose-plugin (>= 2.26.1) | docker-compose (>= 2.26.1), docker-buildx-plugin | docker-buildx
Recommends: docker-ce (>= 5:26) | docker.io (>= 26)
Suggests: nvidia-container-toolkit
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: prepare, serve and transfer offline Ollama and Open WebUI deployments
 Local AI Ferry runs Ollama and Open WebUI with Docker Compose, prepares models
 while connected and moves complete deployments to offline Debian hosts.
 .
 The package operates the system deployment with settings in /etc/loaf and
 data in /var/lib/loaf. Select a portable deployment directory with
 --project-dir. Run 'loaf docs' for the bundled guides.
